#: class-jquery-migrate-helper.php:210
msgid "Your site is using a legacy version of jQuery, 1.12.4-wp, probably in order to fix problems that were experienced with your plugins or themes after an update of WordPress. Please make sure that your plugins and themes become compatible with WordPress 5.6 by contacting the authors."
msgstr "這個網站使用的是舊版的 jQuery (1.12.4-wp)，可能是為了修正 WordPress 核心程式升級後外掛或佈景主題遇到的問題。請聯絡外掛及佈景主題的開發者，以確保網站所使用的外掛及佈景主題能與 WordPress 5.6 相容。"

#: class-jquery-migrate-helper.php:206
