#: admin/header.php:35
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: admin/header.php:30
msgid "When WordPress facilitated for, and is performing, upgrades of the version of jQuery included, some themes and plugins may stop working as expected, because their code was outdated."
msgstr "一旦 WordPress 開始執行內建 jQuery 版本的升級，某些佈景主題及外掛因為程式碼太過老舊，很可能會如預期般停止執行。"

#: admin/header.php:26
msgid "Due to the large amount of plugins and themes using the library, the version has not received any major upgrades to avoid breaking changes. This has unfortunately led to many plugins and themes just using obsolete code (even when WordPress has allowed for more modern code to be used)."
msgstr "大量的外掛及佈景主題使用這個函式庫，且為了避免重大變更而不升級至主要版本，這種狀況造成了即使 WordPress 開放使用較新的程式碼，但許多外掛及佈景主題仍使用已遭淘汰、過時的程式碼。"

#: admin/header.php:22
msgid "Thanks to this versatility, WordPress has included a version of the jQuery library for a long time."
msgstr "WordPress 為了保持這種靈活多用，長期以來一直內建 jQuery 函式庫。"

#: admin/header.php:18
msgid "jQuery is a framework that makes creating interactive elements on your website quick and easy for theme and plugin authors."
msgstr "對佈景主題及外掛開發者來說，jQuery 是一個能夠在網站上快速、便利建立互動元素的架構。"

#: admin/settings.php:102
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "儲存設定"

#: admin/settings.php:96
msgid "Caution: This option may lead to more deprecations being discovered, but will also increase the amount of database entries. Use sparingly and under supervision."
msgstr "請注意，這項設定會導致偵測到更多已淘汰不用項目，也會增加網站資料庫的資料項目數量。請監督的情況下審慎使用這項功能。"

#: admin/settings.php:93
msgid "Log deprecations caused by anonymous users browsing your website"
msgstr "記錄由匿名使用者瀏覽網站所產生的已淘汰不用項目"

#: admin/settings.php:88
msgid "Public deprecation logging"
msgstr "記錄公開瀏覽觸發的已淘汰不用項目"

#: admin/settings.php:80
msgid "This may report many entries from WordPress it self. This is expected, as WordPress continues to update its own code in the upcoming releases."
msgstr "啟用這項設定後，便會顯示由 WordPress 核心程式產生的項目。這些項目的產生一如預期，因為 WordPress 核心程式會在新版本中持續更新內建的程式碼。"

#: admin/settings.php:77
msgid "Detect and log deprecations in the default WordPress version of jQuery"
msgstr "偵測並記錄 WordPress 內建 jQuery 預設版本的已淘汰不用項目"

#: admin/settings.php:72
msgid "Capture modern deprecations"
msgstr "擷取新式已淘汰不用項目"

#: admin/settings.php:50
msgid "Show deprecation notices, on each admin page, as they happen"
msgstr "當淘汰不用的項目在管理後台發生時，顯示相關通知"

#: admin/settings.php:45
msgid "Live deprecations"
msgstr "即時顯示淘汰不用項目"

#: admin/settings.php:37
msgid "You can only change jQuery versions in WordPress 5.6 or later"
msgstr "網站管理員僅能在 WordPress 5.6 或更新版本變更 jQuery 版本"

