#: templates/email/weekly.php:53
msgid "The following deprecations have been logged from the front-end of your site, or from your admin area while live deprecation notices were disabled."
msgstr "以下是從這個網站前端記錄所得的已淘汰不用項目，或是在管理後台停用的即時淘汰不用項目通知。"

#: templates/email/weekly.php:47
msgid "There have been no reported deprecations logged in the past week, maybe you no longer need this plugin?"
msgstr "上週並未記錄到任何已淘汰不用項目，也許你的網站已不再需要這個外掛。"

#: templates/email/weekly.php:38
msgid "Your site is running a legacy version of jQuery, modern functionality is currently not available to your plugins, themes or WordPress itself."
msgstr "你的網站目前執行的是舊版 jQuery，目前新式功能不適用於網站目前使用的外掛、佈景主題或 WordPress 核心程式。"

#: templates/email/weekly.php:31
msgid "This is a weekly summary of the warnings still present on your site, relating to the jQuery library. These errors should be addressed as soon as possible."
msgstr "這是你的網站目前仍出現的 jQuery 函式庫相關警告訊息的每週摘要，網站管理員應儘速解決這些錯誤。"

#. translators: 1: Link to deprecation log page.
#: templates/email/weekly.php:158 templates/email/automatic-downgrade.php:28
msgid "You can view captured and logged deprecations at %s"
msgstr "請在 %s 檢視已擷取並記錄的已淘汰不用項目。"

#: templates/email/automatic-downgrade.php:21
msgid "This happened because you, or a visitor to your site, viewed a page that was using one or more deprecated jQuery features which are no longer in use. As the feature being used is no longer maintained, this caused an error. In order to maintain the expected user experience, this automatic downgrade was performed."
msgstr "會發生這個狀況，是因為你或網站訪客檢視了使用一或多個已淘汰不用的 jQuery 功能的頁面。使用了不再維護的功能，便會造成這項錯誤。為了維護必要的使用者體驗，系統會自動執行 jQuery 降級。"

#: templates/email/automatic-downgrade.php:17
msgid "This is a one-time, automated, message to inform you that the jQuery version on your site has been automatically downgraded to the legacy 1.12.4-wp version."
msgstr "這是僅顯示一次的自動訊息，用來通知網站管理員這個網站的 jQuery 已自動降級至舊版的 1.12.4-wp。"

#: templates/email/weekly.php:27 templates/email/automatic-downgrade.php:13
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "你好！"

#: templates/admin-notices/no-longer-needed.php:30
msgid "You are using a WordPress version prior to 5.5.1. This plugin also helps with a bug found in WordPress 5.5.0. Please update WordPress to version 5.5.1, or later, before deactivating this plugin."
msgstr "這個網站執行的是 WordPress 5.5.1 之前的版本，這個外掛可以協助解決在 WordPress 5.5.0 中發現的程式碼錯誤；網站管理員應在停用這個外掛前，將網站更新至 5.5.1 或更新版本。"

#: templates/admin-notices/no-longer-needed.php:23
msgid "This means you should still check that things work as expected after you have disabled the plugin, and if you know there have been warnings in the admin pages, you may still need to reach out to the authors of the affected plugin or theme."
msgstr "這代表外掛停用後，網站管理員仍須檢查相關項目是否如預期般執行；如果網站在管理後台頁面仍出現警告訊息，網站管理員仍須通知受到影響的外掛或佈景主題開發者。"

#: templates/admin-notices/no-longer-needed.php:19
msgid "Please note that not all jQuery deprecation notices are recorded in the log. Deprecation notices that occur on public pages (front end) are recorded. Notices from the admin pages (back end) are only recorded if the immediate deprecation notices in the admin bar are turned off. Also keep in mind that under WordPress 5.6 logging of deprecation notices are only logged if logging is specifically enabled by the user."
msgstr "請注意，並非全部 jQuery 已淘汰不用項目都會記錄於記錄檔中。系統會記錄發生於網站前端公開頁面的已淘汰不用項目通知，也僅有在關閉管理列上的即時已淘汰不用項目通知後，才會記錄網站後端發生的已淘汰不用項目。此外，在 WordPress 5.6 中，只有在使用者啟用記錄功能後，才會記錄已淘汰不用項目。"

#: templates/admin-notices/welcome.php:34 admin/header.php:36
msgid "Logged deprecations"
msgstr "已記錄的淘汰不用項目"

#: class-jquery-migrate-helper.php:215 templates/admin-notices/welcome.php:34
msgid "Plugin settings"
msgstr "外掛設定"

#: templates/admin-notices/welcome.php:28
msgid "You are currently using a legacy version of jQuery. It has no support and doesn’t receive security updates. Please upgrade as soon as possible."
msgstr "這個網站目前使用了舊版的 jQuery。這個版本已不再提供技術支援及安全性更新，請儘速升級。"

#: templates/admin-notices/welcome.php:22
msgid "If you get warnings, please check for updated versions of the plugin or theme that generated the warning. There will very likely be one you can install. When you have updated your plugins and themes, and there are no more warnings, please deactivate Enable jQuery Migrate Helper."
msgstr "如果在這個網站上看到相關警告訊息，請檢查產生警告訊息的外掛或佈景主題是否已推出更新版本。如果已推出更新版本，請儘速安裝；如果網站管理員更新了外掛及佈景主題後，不再出現任何警告訊息，便可以停用 Enable jQuery Migrate Helper。"

#: templates/admin-notices/welcome.php:17
msgid "This plugin, called Enable jQuery Migrate Helper, is not a fix. It is a temporary solution to give your plugin and theme authors time to update."
msgstr "這個名為 Enable jQuery Migrate Helper 的外掛不是修正程式，它是延長仍未跟上新版 WordPress 核心程式的外掛及佈景主題開發者更新時間的暫時性解決方案。"

#: templates/admin-notices/welcome.php:14
msgid "Right now, you are using a plugin to support some old code in this website’s jQuery JavaScript library. That code is deprecated, meaning it is basically obsolete and is losing the support of your themes and plugins and WordPress itself."
msgstr "目前這個網站使用了支援網站中老舊 jQuery JavaScript 函式庫的外掛。這些程式碼已淘汰不用，這代表這些過時的程式碼會失去目前使用的佈景主題、外掛及 WordPress 核心程式的支援。"

#: templates/admin-notices/deprecated-scripts.php:18
msgid "Please make sure you are using the latest version of all of your plugins, and your theme. If that is the case, then you may want to ask the developers of the code mentioned in your warnings to update it."
msgstr "請確認這個網站使用的外掛及佈景主題均為最新版本。如果外掛及佈景主題已是最新版本，請要求警告訊息中出現的對應程式的開發者更新程式碼。"

